decision time

context: Appointments, opening hours and calendar slots all handle times of day
decision: A time of day is Minute(int), minutes since midnight; durations are plain int minutes
rationale: One unit avoids hour/minute mix-ups; the calendar library speaks plain ints, converted with int(m)
enforcement: Minute is Minute(int); show times with clinic.schedule.clock
examples:
    ✓ type Minute = Minute(int)
    ✗ type Minute = Minute(str)
